18527,"Your Online Statement Summary is Now Available.
Dear Customer Your online statement summary is now available to view online. View Statement Have you considered going paperless? By switching to online statements, you can manage your account easily while reducing mail and paper cluttering your desk. Plus, when you stop your monthly credit card account statements, you can help the environment by reducing paper consumption. Go Paperless now! When you go paperless, you can: View the same information that's on your official paper statement.  Receive monthly e-mail notification when your new official statement is available to view online.  Decrease the possibility of mail fraud and identity theft. What's the difference between an official statement & online statement summary? Your online statement summary contains most of the same details about charges, credits and payments as the official statement you receive by post each month. However, it does not include all the information that is on your official statement such as account disclosures or statement messages, so it is important to review your official statement. Please read, important information about e-mail security. So you can recognize a genuine e-mail from your Alliance & Leicester Credit Card when you receive one we'll always quote the last 4 digits of your Alliance & Leicester Credit Card number: 7673 Please don't reply to this e-mail with any account details, as e-mail is not a secure form of communication. If you do not want us to contact you by e-mail for marketing purposes, you can Click here and follow the instructions. If you do so, we will ensure that we will only ever send you e-mails about your account. *You will be charged a handling fee for balance transfers, money transfers and credit card check & cash transactions, unless we have told you otherwise of 3% (minimum 3). This applies unless we have told you that your fee is more or less than this percentage. You can transfer balances up to 95% of your available balance. You cannot transfer a balance from another card issued by MONA. Your promotional rate, should there be one on your account, will no longer apply from the beginning of any statement period during which you breach your terms and conditions. If you settle other cards or loans your monthly payment may be lower. Your other loan providers may charge you for settling other loans early. When you pay us, we will put your payments towards your balances with the lowest and longest rates first. The Alliance & Leicester Credit Card is issued by MONA Europe Bank Limited, Registered Office: Stanfield House, Chester Business Park, Chester CH4 9QQ. Registered in England number 2783251. MONA is authorized and regulated by the Financial Services Authority. Alliance & Leicester is a trademark of Alliance & Leicester Plc and is used under license. Em0484-cm-s-anlpaperless1b",i06,Contact and Conversation,"GENERAL SETTINGS
